-- 035b: Mosaic Draftable / Undrafted metric view. DRAFT STATUS: edw_test only - do not promote
-- to edw_prod without approval. Generated by _gen_035b_draftable_metric_view.py - edit that, not this.
--
-- WHY: the Executive Dashboard's "Draftable, Undrafted" page (and Genie) need the PBI Volume
-- report's Draftable analysis as a governed metric view.
-- SOURCE: edw_test.enterprise_analytics.mosaic_draftable_snapshot_mv (035a), a 1:1 daily snapshot
-- of edw_dev.bipa_analytics.examsnotdraftedbutdraftable_vw - the table PBI imports - so the
-- category logic is PBI's by construction.
-- PBI parity: Draftable Exam Count = Draftable[Exam Count]; each Pct <category> =
-- [Category % of Draftable] for that category; Radiologist Count = [Rad Count].
-- Not carried over (broken in PBI as of 2026-10-24): [Total Draftable] (references missing table
-- draftabletotals_vw) and [Category % of Week] (filters on stale category names -> blank).
--
-- ADDITIVE ONLY: plain CREATE VIEW (no OR REPLACE).

CREATE VIEW edw_test.enterprise_analytics.mosaic_draftable_metric_view
COMMENT 'MOSAIC DRAFTABLE / UNDRAFTED SEMANTIC LAYER (draft, edw_test only). Every Mosaic exam on a drafting-eligible RPID, classified into the PBI 8-category waterfall explaining why it was or was not drafted. Source = daily snapshot of the PBI Draftable table (examsnotdraftedbutdraftable_vw).'
WITH METRICS
LANGUAGE YAML
AS
$$
version: 1.1
source: edw_test.enterprise_analytics.mosaic_draftable_snapshot_mv
comment: Why draftable Mosaic exams were or were not drafted (PBI Volume report Draftable page). See CREATE VIEW comment.
dimensions:
- name: Calendar Date
  expr: source.calendar_date
  comment: Exam calendar date (legacy calendar_date). Bind the dashboard Period filter here.
- name: Week Start
  expr: source.week_start_monday
  comment: Monday that starts the Mon-Sun week. The legacy/PBI column holding this is (mis)named week_end; PBI's own [Week Start] calc column (= week_end - 6) is a further 6 days earlier.
- name: Month
  expr: DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', source.calendar_date)
  comment: Calendar month of the exam date.
- name: PBI Month (by week)
  expr: DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', source.week_start_monday)
  comment: 'Month bucket PBI uses (Draftable[Month Start] = month of week_end). Only for reproducing PBI month visuals: a week spanning a month boundary lands wholly in the month of its Monday.'
- name: Category
  expr: source.category
  comment: 'Why a draftable exam was or was not drafted. First match wins: Drafted > RAD not enabled - Rad declined > Ops declined > Incomplete process > PRACTICE not enabled for model > Exam never opened > DRAFT not available - opened <5 min > opened >5 min. Sort with Category Sort Order.'
- name: Category Sort Order
  expr: source.category_sort_order
  comment: 0 = Drafted ... 7 = Exam never opened.
- name: Category Group
  expr: CASE WHEN source.category = 'Drafted' THEN 'Drafted' WHEN source.category LIKE 'RAD not enabled%' THEN 'Radiologist not enabled' WHEN source.category = 'PRACTICE not enabled for model' THEN 'Practice not enabled' ELSE 'Enabled, draft not used' END
  comment: 'Owner-level roll-up of Category: Radiologist not enabled (consent / ops / enablement), Practice not enabled (model roll-out), Enabled, draft not used (workflow / product).'
- name: Is Drafted
  expr: source.category = 'Drafted'
  comment: TRUE if the exam was drafted.
- name: Team
  expr: source.Team
  comment: Radiologist's roster team (Provider Practice sub-team). PBI Draftable[Team].
- name: Team Rolled Up
  expr: source.team_rolled_up
  comment: Provider Practice rolled up via tbl_team_rollups (PBI 'Team Rolled up' = Provider Practice).
- name: Local Region
  expr: source.local_region
  comment: 6 fixed regions, exact copy of PBI Draftable[Localdraf] keyed on Team. Differs from the volume view's Local Region for a few Teams - see 035a comment.
- name: Local Practice
  expr: source.local_practice
  comment: Exam's local practice short name (legacy local_practice = local_practice_short_name).
- name: Site
  expr: source.site
  comment: Exam location.
- name: Radiologist Name
  expr: source.Radiologist
  comment: Reading radiologist.
- name: NPI
  expr: CAST(source.npi AS STRING)
  comment: Reading radiologist NPI.
- name: Exam Category
  expr: source.exam_category
  comment: Exam category from exam_category_lookup_xwalk (ParentRpt).
- name: Drafting Model
  expr: source.drafting_model
  comment: Declared AI drafting model / capturable category for the RPID (XR/MSK, CT Chest, CT Abd/Pel, CT Spine, CT Head, US Capturable, DEXA Capturable).
measures:
- name: Draftable Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count)
  comment: All Mosaic exams on drafting-eligible RPIDs (all 8 categories, Drafted included). = PBI Draftable[Exam Count]. Denominator of every Pct measure.
- name: Draftable TBWU
  expr: SUM(source.tbwu)
  comment: TBWU of draftable exams. = PBI [Category Value] with Metric Selector = TBWU.
- name: Radiologist Count
  expr: COUNT(DISTINCT source.Radiologist)
  comment: Distinct radiologists by name. = PBI Draftable[Rad Count] (DISTINCTCOUNT Radiologist).
- name: Undrafted Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category <> 'Drafted')
  comment: Draftable exams that were not drafted (categories 1-7).
- name: Undrafted TBWU
  expr: SUM(source.tbwu) FILTER (WHERE source.category <> 'Drafted')
  comment: TBWU of draftable exams not drafted.
- name: Radiologists With Undrafted Exams
  expr: COUNT(DISTINCT source.Radiologist) FILTER (WHERE source.category <> 'Drafted')
  comment: Distinct radiologists with at least one undrafted draftable exam.
- name: Drafted Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'Drafted')
  comment: Exams in category 0 'Drafted'.
- name: Rad Declined Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'RAD not enabled - Rad declined')
  comment: Exams in category 1 'RAD not enabled - Rad declined'.
- name: Ops Declined Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'RAD not enabled - Ops declined')
  comment: Exams in category 2 'RAD not enabled - Ops declined'.
- name: Incomplete Process Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'RAD not enabled - Incomplete process')
  comment: Exams in category 3 'RAD not enabled - Incomplete process'.
- name: Practice Not Enabled Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'PRACTICE not enabled for model')
  comment: Exams in category 4 'PRACTICE not enabled for model'.
- name: Opened Under 5 Min Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in <5 min')
  comment: Exams in category 5 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in <5 min'.
- name: Opened Over 5 Min Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in >5 min')
  comment: Exams in category 6 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in >5 min'.
- name: Never Opened Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category = 'Exam never opened, not drafted')
  comment: Exams in category 7 'Exam never opened, not drafted'.
- name: Pct Drafted
  expr: MEASURE(`Drafted Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Drafted / draftable. = PBI [Category % of Draftable] for Drafted.
- name: Pct Undrafted
  expr: MEASURE(`Undrafted Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Undrafted / draftable (= 1 - Pct Drafted).
- name: Pct Rad Declined
  expr: MEASURE(`Rad Declined Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'RAD not enabled - Rad declined'. = PBI [Category % of Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
- name: Pct Ops Declined
  expr: MEASURE(`Ops Declined Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'RAD not enabled - Ops declined'. = PBI [Category % of Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
- name: Pct Incomplete Process
  expr: MEASURE(`Incomplete Process Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'RAD not enabled - Incomplete process'. = PBI [Category % of Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
- name: Pct Practice Not Enabled
  expr: MEASURE(`Practice Not Enabled Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'PRACTICE not enabled for model'. = PBI [Category % of Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
- name: Pct Opened Under 5 Min
  expr: MEASURE(`Opened Under 5 Min Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in <5 min'. = PBI [Category % of Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
- name: Pct Opened Over 5 Min
  expr: MEASURE(`Opened Over 5 Min Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'DRAFT not available - Exam opened in >5 min'. = PBI [Category % of Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
- name: Pct Never Opened
  expr: MEASURE(`Never Opened Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams in 'Exam never opened, not drafted'. = PBI [Category % of Draftable] for that category (denominator = all 8 categories incl. Drafted).
- name: Rad Not Enabled Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category LIKE 'RAD not enabled%')
  comment: Rad declined + Ops declined + Incomplete process (rad drafted <10% of the model's exams that week).
- name: Draft Not Used Exam Count
  expr: SUM(source.exam_count) FILTER (WHERE source.category LIKE 'DRAFT not available%' OR source.category = 'Exam never opened, not drafted')
  comment: 'Rad and practice enabled but no draft used: opened <5 min, opened >5 min, or never opened. The workflow / product bucket.'
- name: Pct Rad Not Enabled
  expr: MEASURE(`Rad Not Enabled Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams lost to radiologist enablement (consent / ops / incomplete).
- name: Pct Draft Not Used
  expr: MEASURE(`Draft Not Used Exam Count`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable Exam Count`), 0)
  comment: Share of draftable exams where rad and practice were enabled but no draft was used.
- name: Pct Undrafted TBWU
  expr: MEASURE(`Undrafted TBWU`) / NULLIF(MEASURE(`Draftable TBWU`), 0)
  comment: TBWU-weighted undrafted share (= 1 - PBI [Category % of Draftable] for Drafted with Metric Selector = TBWU).
- name: Data Through Date
  expr: MAX(source.calendar_date)
  comment: Last calendar date in the snapshot (legacy view keeps completed Mon-Sun weeks only).
$$
